abstract: >
  AetherPolicy is a candidate ninth project of the Aether family. It
  investigates whether a decentralized policy lifecycle gap genuinely
  exists between governance authority (AetherGovern) and runtime
  monitoring (AetherRuntime). This document states a hypothesis under
  investigation. The project is paused at Phase 4 (Independence Decision),
  and the decision is (E) undetermined: the argument is insufficient to
  accept AetherPolicy as an independent dimension and insufficient to
  reject it. No implementation, test, or experiment is reported.
